# TRIAL fragment (task R20): built-in (=y) code the RG34XX-SP cannot use. NOT part of the default
# build until device task K3 (serial console) can show the board still boots with it:
#   scripts/build-kernel.sh --fragment config/rg34xxsp-builtin-trim.config
# Every line is checked to hold (scripts/build-kernel.sh step 2a). Grouped by reason.

# --- Firmware and platform features the board does not have
# CONFIG_XEN is not set
# CONFIG_EFI is not set
# CONFIG_NUMA is not set
# CONFIG_MEMORY_HOTPLUG is not set
# CONFIG_HIBERNATION is not set
# CONFIG_ARM_SCMI_PROTOCOL is not set
